<title>TURKEY: Five bodies found after Turkish coal mine blast.</title>
<headline>Five bodies found after Turkish coal mine blast.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The bodies of five mine workers who went missing two days ago in an explosion at a small coal mine in northwest Turkey were recovered on Sunday, state-run Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The agency said Friday's blast at the privately owned mine in the village of Ovacik was probably caused by a gas leak.</p>
</text>
